\newlabel{tab:bench}{{3}{10}{Test-period benchmark performance. Sharpe ratios are annualized and pooled over each market's OOS months. EV is descriptive test-period regression fit. RMS $\alpha $ and max$|\alpha |$ are monthly percentage points. The linear SDF uses the common kernel in \eqref {eq:sdf} with weights linear in characteristics}{table.3}{}}
