\@writefile{lot}{\contentsline {table}{\numberline {4}{\ignorespaces Deep-SDF pricing summary against benchmarks. RMS $\alpha $ in monthly percentage points; ranges span the eight reported deep specifications at seed 42. ``Paired $\Delta $RMS'' is the baseline E2 minus the strongest pricing benchmark of its market (Market in Iran, the q-factor in T\"urkiye, LASSO in Pakistan), with a 95\% window-level bootstrap interval (10,000 resamples of the 6--12 OOS windows; each window's errors share one trained model, so windows are the resampling unit). Intervals excluding zero are marked *.}}{11}{table.4}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{tab:pricing}{{4}{11}{Deep-SDF pricing summary against benchmarks. RMS $\alpha $ in monthly percentage points; ranges span the eight reported deep specifications at seed 42. ``Paired $\Delta $RMS'' is the baseline E2 minus the strongest pricing benchmark of its market (Market in Iran, the q-factor in T\"urkiye, LASSO in Pakistan), with a 95\% window-level bootstrap interval (10,000 resamples of the 6--12 OOS windows; each window's errors share one trained model, so windows are the resampling unit). Intervals excluding zero are marked *}{table.4}{}}
